      "scene_type": "gb_build",
      "spoken": "The figures from Swiss rail operator SBB: 57 kilometres long, the longest rail tunnel in the world according to SBB, opened in June 2016. Since then, 276,000 freight trains and 169,000 passenger trains have run through it.",
